          "worked": "At $x=0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=\\frac{-2(0)+3}{2}\\\\y&=\\frac32\\end{align*}$$\nAt $y=0$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{-2x+3}{2}&=0\\\\-2x+3&=0\\\\-2x&=-3\\\\x&=\\frac32\\end{align*}$$\nDraw the straight line through $(\\tfrac32,0)$ and $(0,\\tfrac32)$.",
